  "details": "I guess this one should be places in the regular bug reports. But it still occur in 1357 beta. Sorry!\n\nLine to drop portal starts lagging like crazy. Can't abort dropping the portal. Happened to everyone in the instance when they tried to drop a portal.\n\nTo reproduce, go to that world and try to drop a portal. Works in vr and desktop.\n\nYou can't respawn in that world. Since it says that it's missing a spawn point when you try. If that is of help.\n\nWorld: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_23e2fea5-73dc-42fd-8f5c-2ff454cf6c45\n\nLogs: https://gist.github.com/Tummy-git/74f13ed852a29375876ab23070c4cf48\n\nVideo: https://youtu.be/ALP1ossSr-M",
